	)
	(text "Reference board by ST has an extra 100pF cap in parallel,\nbut phil explains this is not necessary since we're going\nto use modern packages that are small enough - such that we\ncan place the 100nF cap close enough to the VDDRF pin. and\nthat in this case the 100pF cap doesn't matter and doesn't\nadd anything."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.18 48.768 0)
